s/2026/08/3-232x300.png 232w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/3-791x1024.png 791w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/3-768x994.png 768w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/3-1187x1536.png 1187w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/3-640x828.png 640w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/3-500x647.png 500w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/3.png 1545w" sizes="(max-width: 655px) 100vw, 655px" /></a></div><div data-thumb="https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-180x180.jpg" data-thumb-alt="ALPHABET CRAFTS BUNDLE: What a fun way to play with the alphabet! These alphabet craft activities are so much fun and perfect for toddlers and preschoolers learning the ABCs - from Busy Toddler" data-thumb-srcset="https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-180x180.jpg 180w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-500x500.jpg 500w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-450x450.jpg 450w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-300x300.jpg 300w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-400x400.jpg 400w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-125x125.jpg 125w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-150x150.jpg 150w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare.jpg 650w"  data-thumb-sizes="(max-width: 180px) 100vw, 180px" class="woocommerce-product-gallery__image"><a href="https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare.jpg"><img width="650" height="650" src="https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare.jpg" class="" alt="ALPHABET CRAFTS BUNDLE: What a fun way to play with the alphabet! These alphabet craft activities are so much fun and perfect for toddlers and preschoolers learning the ABCs - from Busy Toddler" data-caption="" data-src="https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare.jpg" data-large_image="https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare.jpg" data-large_image_width="650" data-large_image_height="650" decoding="async" srcset="https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare.jpg 650w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-500x500.jpg 500w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-180x180.jpg 180w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-450x450.jpg 450w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-300x300.jpg 300w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-400x400.jpg 400w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-125x125.jpg 125w, https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/alphabetportfoliosquare-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px" /></a></div></div></div><div class="summary"><h1 class="product_title entry-title">Playing Preschool Year 1</h1><p class="price"><span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount"><bdi><span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol" translate="no" dir="auto">&#36;</span>39.90</bdi></span></p><div class="woocommerce-product-details__short-description"><p><em><strong>Preschool is so much more than memorizing the ABCs and 123s.</strong> </em>Playing Preschool Year 1 is a comprehensive, secular, play-based program designed to build a strong educational foundation while honoring how young children learn best. Across 19 thoughtfully sequenced units, children build skills in literacy, math, science, art, and motor development through carefully selected read-alouds, curated discussions, and hands-on activities.</p><p>Children investigate ideas, make connections, and share their thinking as they grow their understanding of the world around them. Skills build in complexity throughout the year, giving children the time and experience they need to develop as curious and confident learners. <em>Playing Preschool combines thoughtful lesson plans with detailed guidance to make preschool at home doable, joyful, and effective.</em></p><p><strong>Pages:</strong> 314 pages of lesson plans and resources <br /><strong>Program Length:</strong> 38 weeks of fully planned lessons <br /><strong>Daily Time:</strong> Approximately 45-60 minutes per lesson <br /><strong>Recommended Ages:</strong> 2.5 to 5 years old <br /><strong>Subjects:</strong> Early literacy, mathematics, science, sensory exploration, fine arts, and motor development</p><p><em>Authored by Susie Allison, M. Ed.</em></p><p><strong>This program is sold as a non-refundable digital PDF.</strong></p></div><form class="cart" action="https://shop.busytoddler.com/product/playing-preschool-complete-program/" method="post" enctype='multipart/form-data'><div class="quantity"> <label class="screen-reader-text" for="quantity_6ada5f8bf2d87">Playing Preschool Year 1 quantity</label> <input
