div></nav><footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap"><p>&#xA9;&nbsp;2026 by <a href="https://www.anchoreddesign.com/downloads/busy-toddler" target="_blank">Busy Toddler LLC</a> · <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/disclosure-policy"> Disclosure Policy</a> · <a href="https://www.anchoreddesign.com" target="_blank">Website by Anchored Design</a></p></div></footer></div> <script defer src="data:text/javascript;base64,"></script> <script defer src="data:text/javascript;base64,"></script> <script defer src="data:text/javascript;base64,"></script> <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@type":"Product","@id":"https://shop.busytoddler.com/product/playing-preschool-complete-program/#product","name":"Playing Preschool Year 1","url":"https://shop.busytoddler.com/product/playing-preschool-complete-program/","description":"Preschool is so much more than memorizing the ABCs and 123s. Playing Preschool Year 1 is a comprehensive, secular, play-based program designed to build a strong educational foundation while honoring how young children learn best. Across 19 thoughtfully sequenced units, children build skills in literacy, math, science, art, and motor development through carefully selected read-alouds, curated discussions, and hands-on activities.\r\nChildren investigate ideas, make connections, and share their thinking as they grow their understanding of the world around them. Skills build in complexity throughout the year, giving children the time and experience they need to develop as curious and confident learners. Playing Preschool combines thoughtful lesson plans with detailed guidance to make preschool at home doable, joyful, and effective.\r\nPages: 314 pages of lesson plans and resources Program Length: 38 weeks of fully planned lessons Daily Time: Approximately 45-60 minutes per lesson Recommended Ages: 2.5 to 5 years old Subjects: Early literacy, mathematics, science, sensory exploration, fine arts, and motor development\r\nAuthored by Susie Allison, M. Ed.\r\nThis program is sold as a non-refundable digital PDF.","image":"https://shop.busytoddler.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/playing-preschool-1.png","sku":4868,"offers":[{"@type":"Offer","priceSpecification":[{"@type":"UnitPriceSpecification","price":"39.90","priceCurrency":"USD","validThrough":"2027-12-31","valueAddedTaxIncluded":false}],"priceValidUntil":"2027-12-31","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","url":"https://shop.busytoddler.com/product/playing-preschool-complete-program/","seller":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Busy Toddler","url":"https://shop.busytoddler.com"},"price":"39.90","priceCurrency":"USD"}]}</script> <!-- Facebook Pixel Code --> <noscript> <img
